To view the current CLA text, verify its digest, and execute the signature:
```bash
uv run ditto cla sign --wallet-name <wallet> --hotkey-name <hotkey>
```
The CLI will display the text and SHA-256 digest, require explicit confirmation (`I AGREE`), and submit your hotkey signature to Platform.

> **Rollout Gate**: Platform operates the CLA submission gate in three stages: `off`, `shadow` (monitoring adoption without blocking), and `enforce`. In `enforce` mode, uploads will be rejected with an error instructing you to run `uv run ditto cla sign`.
